<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>For Ivanjilin ❤️</title>
<style>
body{
    margin:0;
    font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff9a9e,#fad0c4);
    text-align:center;
    color:white;
}
.container{
    padding:50px 20px;
}
h1{
    font-size:3em;
}
.card{
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    padding:20px;
    border-radius:20px;
    max-width:500px;
    margin:auto;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <h1>❤️ Ivanjilin ❤️</h1>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>My Special Message</h2>
        <p>
            Dear Ivanjilin,<br><br>
            Thank you for being part of my life.
            Every day with you is special.
            This small website was made just for you. 💖
            <br><br>
            Forever Yours,<br>
            Hari ❤️
        </p>
    </div>

    <h2 style="margin-top:40px;">💞 I Love You 💞</h2>
</div>
</body>
</html>
